--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e32d70991a71c9649876788061c5a6cd, type: 3}
  m_Name: Introduction - 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  hasChapterIntro: 0
  chapterNumber: 
  chapterName: 
  sentences:
  - text: "\u2026my limbs\u2026 they're all intact again?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: 1606658783463881559, guid: 40727bcd591a05448acb2f6861bb4f08, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'You fainted due to blood loss. Your limbs have already been reattached,
      you should be able to feel them again. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1787240519333269993, guid: f2a495eec40429f46add8d4fb61e5091, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'Although you did trespass on the Garden, I also confiscated your limbs
      without your consent, so treat this as an apology. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1787240519333269993, guid: f2a495eec40429f46add8d4fb61e5091, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 4114157388386300877, guid: 5aa8130d623ac8149ae0912a814ac8e6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: "And uhh\u2026 the warning.. is it still\u2026? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: 1606658783463881559, guid: 40727bcd591a05448acb2f6861bb4f08, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'No, you needn''t hold your tongue now. I had a few thoughts while you
      were blacked out. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1787240519333269993, guid: f2a495eec40429f46add8d4fb61e5091, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'Fortunately for you, we are currently understaffed, and I present to you
      a proposal: You''ll help out here in the Garden. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1787240519333269993, guid: f2a495eec40429f46add8d4fb61e5091, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: "\u2026is this an elaborate scheme to kidnap people? Triads really are
      getting a bit too creative with their methods these days\u2026 "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -4777918531010614747, guid: 34ee96cfd07cb8446ae90d1d480e3754, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'I''ve heard stories of the Prospect Garden hiring people from small-time
      indie fixers to kidnap people for all kinds of twisted experiments. That''s
      going to be me soon, isn''t it? You''re just a branch of the Prospect Garden,
      aren''t you?! '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -559025268487425864, guid: 7aec235609635184db2bb983ac5a27bd, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: "Ugh\u2026 my life is really an unfortunate mess. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: 7073982150870612447, guid: 5563c4b7c8309f94f91b342d4cb160be, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'This is Penglai Garden, truly a garden. I don''t know the Prospect Garden
      you''re talking about, but this place isn''t owned by a Triad at least. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: 6245203943244449581, guid: afbb448068b26134c9afa588342ecad8, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 8638030418892782636, guid: 5882e8749ab2fd94785bf5a006373826, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'Well, regardless of the case, I''m trapped here and you''ll exploit me,
      right? '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -4777918531010614747, guid: 34ee96cfd07cb8446ae90d1d480e3754, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 5361410859545721485, guid: ab26f2ca280cf114f8b2c830cb06e509, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'Yes. However, I''m letting you live for two main reasons. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'First, to figure out how you could enter this place uninvited. It could
      pose a significant threat to the garden, should I neglect this. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'Second, I require memories from this world, the purpose for which you
      needn''t know. You will assist in the process. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'Since you are a resident of the Mainland, I expect you to be helpful in
      various ways. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: "Gahh\u2026. I knew this would happen to me eventually one day! People
      would disappear without a trace, only to show up weeks later as barely identifiable
      chunks of flesh\u2026 "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: 1606658783463881559, guid: 40727bcd591a05448acb2f6861bb4f08, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: "I would keep those stories close to heart and tread carefully, but now
      do I know that such situations have nothing to do with carelessness\u2026 it
      can happen in a moment's notice..! "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: 1606658783463881559, guid: 40727bcd591a05448acb2f6861bb4f08, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'Don''t be so concerned for your life, you will not die here unless I permit
      it. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1787240519333269993, guid: f2a495eec40429f46add8d4fb61e5091, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'So I was right! This IS a crazy mad scientist''s laboratory! You''re going
      to keep me alive for your sick, twisted experiments! '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -559025268487425864, guid: 7aec235609635184db2bb983ac5a27bd, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: "What's your deal\u2026 taking people off the trails and shoving them into
      tubes where you feed them all sorts of wind chimes and doohickeys until they
      turn into wind chime people?! I'd rather die than be subjected to such a fate! "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -559025268487425864, guid: 7aec235609635184db2bb983ac5a27bd, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'If you continue to spout such nonsense, I''ll gladly turn you into a wind
      chime person as you so wish to become. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: 2485217457180400858, guid: 20c67fb15d6f3794cb0c28a6c5d5e7c2, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 8336303855667819306, guid: f8b19d39682d24840b4cee26a2b20e00, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'Sorry, sir. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -4777918531010614747, guid: 34ee96cfd07cb8446ae90d1d480e3754, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3603269594960806020, guid: 227a54e40ea747e41babac0e8b293d46, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: 'Now, let me introduce myself properly. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  - text: I am Lu Dongbin, the head caretaker of this garden.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fda57ca6cb9d1f44f945d6e443627a54, type: 2}
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
  backgroud: {fileID: 7692112337033927237, guid: c947a8a5a79326c4aa5510dd107d258e, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2ba021fbe5e097347b363dbe5ebda5af, type: 2}
